WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.000
Your AI agent is still coding… so your Mac stays open. Everywhere.
[POV: a half-open MacBook carried on the street, the subway, a café, the bathroom; the token counter keeps climbing.]

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.000
“AI coders are carrying half-open laptops through airports, offices, and ice rinks.” — Business Insider

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.400
Those days are over.
[The lid closes and the Mac goes into the bag.]

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:16.400
Your Mac sleeps only when you want it to.
Even with the lid closed: the download and the tests finish.

5
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:22.400
In the bag, it keeps an eye on the heat.
[Battery at 46 °C. Notification: “Your Mac is getting warm — Display and Wi-Fi slowed down to cool it.” The temperature drops.] It protects itself.

6
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:28.500
No Wi-Fi? It joins your iPhone, on its own.
[The Mac connects to “My iPhone” Personal Hotspot.]

7
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.700
[Menu bar: one click on “Always awake”, the moon opens its eye.]
One switch.

8
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:38.100
Nuit Blanche. Your Mac stays up. You don’t have to.
Free · for Mac — connected-mate.github.io/nuit-blanche
